Vendor crossover FIR coefficients (read-only, part of the locked
pipeline). Locked conv filters must point under this directory
(camilladsp-genconf enforces it); user FIRs live elsewhere, e.g.
/opt/user_data.

The shipped wf_fir.txt / tw_fir.txt are 1-tap passthrough placeholders
(gain 1.0). Replace with the real corrective FIR designs from
scripts/camilladsp_xo_coeffs.py (docs/crossover-to-camilladsp.md) via
an image build; coefficient updates are a vendor action (OPKG/image),
never a websocket one. TEXT format: one coefficient per line.
